Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: 8Kloud Switcher
Source: https://github.com/moocowsheep/8KloudSwitcher
Comment:
 The package also ships, in the private directory
 /usr/lib/*/8kloud-switcher, an LGPL-2.1+ build of FFmpeg produced by
 packaging/build-ffmpeg-lgpl.sh, and the MIT-licensed OMT runtime
 (libomt.so, libvmx.so). The FFmpeg build is deliberately NOT the
 distribution's: Debian and Ubuntu configure FFmpeg with --enable-gpl, which
 makes it GPL-2.0-or-later, and a binary linking that could not be conveyed
 under this package's MPL-2.0 terms alongside the proprietary NVIDIA CUDA /
 NVENC runtime and the Blackmagic DeckLink SDK.

